      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e47570bc00097642a1685264047ed12bff695a516aa08938204f08ea993aa0b4",
      "text": "Duration: 4 Hours • Pick Up: 9:00–9:30 am • Language: English and Spanish. Explore Oaxaca’s UNESCO-listed historic center with a certified bilingual guide, visiting Santo Domingo Church, the Andador Turístico, the Zócalo, and artisan markets while learning about Zapotec and Mixtec heritage, colonial history, and modern traditions. Afterward, enjoy free time or choose optional experiences such as a cooking class, gallery visits, or mezcal tasting. Included: Shared transportation, certified bilingual guide, entry to key historic sites, overnight in Oaxaca. Not included: Meals, entrance fees to optional sites, tips, personal expenses.",
